<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Prenota la tua Consulenza — Formula 0</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --green: #16a34a;
      --green-light: #dcfce7;
      --black: #0a0a0a;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --gray: #f8f9fa;
    }
    body {
      background: var(--white);
      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
      color: var(--black);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* ── HEADER URGENCY BAR ── */
    .urgency-bar {
      background: var(--black);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .urgency-bar span { color: #4ade80; }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--green-light);
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 44px);
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--black);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero h1 .green { color: var(--green); }

    .hero p {
      font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 18px);
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #444;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    /* ── BULLETS ── */
    .bullets {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .bullet {
      background: var(--gray);
      border: 1.5px solid #e5e5e5;
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #222;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .bullet .dot {
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      background: var(--green);
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── DIVIDER ── */
    .divider {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }
    .divider hr { flex: 1; border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5; }
    .divider span { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #999; white-space: nowrap; }

    /* ── CALENDLY ── */
    .calendly-section {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 16px 60px;
    }
    .calendly-inline-widget {
      min-width: 320px;
      height: 700px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    /* ── SOCIAL PROOF ── */
    .social-section {
      background: var(--gray);
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .social-section h3 {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #999;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .testimonials {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .testi {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1.5px solid #e5e5e5;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      max-width: 260px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .testi .stars { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .testi p { font-size: 13px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
    .testi .author { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #111; }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #bbb;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }
    footer a { color: #bbb; text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero { padding: 32px 16px 24px; }
      .calendly-inline-widget { height: 580px; }
      .bullets { gap: 8px; }
      .bullet { font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 14px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- URGENCY BAR -->
  <div class="urgency-bar">
    ⚡ Solo <span>9 posti disponibili</span> questa settimana — Prenota ora prima che si esauriscano
  </div>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="badge">Consulenza 1:1 Gratuita</div>
    <h1>Prenota Il Tuo Posto e Scopri<br>Come <span class="green">Costruire Un'Entrata Extra</span><br>Già Dal Primo Mese</h1>
    <p>In questa chiamata di <strong>30 minuti</strong> ti mostro esattamente come funziona il Sistema Multi Affiliate, rispondo a tutte le tue domande e valutiamo insieme se fa al caso tuo. <strong>Zero pressioni, zero obblighi.</strong></p>

    <!-- BULLETS -->
    <div class="bullets">
      <div class="bullet"><div class="dot"></div>Chiamata 1:1 con Luca</div>
      <div class="bullet"><div class="dot"></div>Durata 30 minuti</div>
      <div class="bullet"><div class="dot"></div>Completamente gratuita</div>
      <div class="bullet"><div class="dot"></div>Nessun obbligo</div>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider">
      <hr/>
      <span>Scegli data e orario qui sotto</span>
      <hr/>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CALENDLY -->
  <div class="calendly-section">
    <div class="calendly-inline-widget" data-url="https://calendly.com/lucapuleo/consulenza-gratuita-1-1?hide_gdpr_banner=1"></div>
    <script type="text/javascript" src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" async></script>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Formula 0 · Luca Puleo · <a href="https://formula-0.systeme.io/c91a3235" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
